    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94099" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σῐκελ-ός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <u>Sicel</u>, later <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>Sicilian, of</i> or <i>from
				Sicily</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυνὴ Σ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				24.211
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				389
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφίπολος</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				366
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαῖα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thgn.
					783
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάγος, πόντος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Cyc.</u>
				95
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				703
			</span></i>, etc.: rare in Prose, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυροὶ
			Σ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				8.4.3
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σ. ἔλαιον</span> a liquid form
			of asphalt, <i><span class="en">
